OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry and mostly cloudy day but
OL,6,Fsome bright or sunny intervals
OL,7,Fbreaking through. Breezy southeasterly
OL,8,Fwinds will strengthen through the day
OL,9,Fwith a risk of gales over Orkney.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA dry evening with cloud
OL,12,Fthickening and lowering. Overcast with
OL,13,Flow cloud overnight and a few spots of
OL,14,Flight rain possible. Strong
OL,15,Fsoutheasterly winds with gales or
OL,16,Fsevere gales.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
