OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FCloudy with rain, heavy at
OL,6,Ftimes, spreading northeastwards and
OL,7,Fclearing Orkney in the afternoon and
OL,8,FShetland in the evening. Strong
OL,9,Fsoutheasterly winds with gale risk
OL,10,Fdiminishing through the day.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,13,FLargely dry Thursday with a the odd
OL,14,Fshower possible and sunny spells.
OL,15,FCloudy on Friday with rain spreading
OL,16,Feastwards. Mostly cloudy with showers
OL,17,Fon Saturday. Breezy at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
